        "subtitle": "The 4Cs of Tanzanite",
        "heading": "Colour",
        "content": "<p>Colour is one of the most important and captivating characteristics of Tanzanite.</p><p>Tanzanite is celebrated for its beautiful spectrum of <strong>blue and violet hues</strong>, ranging from lighter violet-blue tones to deep, intensely saturated blues.</p><p>Generally, stones displaying a rich, vivid colour with strong saturation are particularly prized. Larger Tanzanites can also exhibit greater depth of colour, while smaller stones often appear lighter.</p><p>One of Tanzanite's most fascinating characteristics is its <strong>pleochroism</strong>; the ability to display different colours when viewed from different directions.</p>",
